<title>GREECE: DELTA INFORM RIGHTS ISSUE DELAYED.</title>
<headline>DELTA INFORM RIGHTS ISSUE DELAYED.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Informatics' plan for a rights issue will seek shareholder approval again in a new meeting in 20 days as Tuesday's general assembly failed to reach a quorum to approve the plan. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
